{"id":1823111,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-11T18:49:24.968Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/yELCdjSRSbS09iEtecYnpBjPeCZ.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1823111,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["CR"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"3 Hearts of Iron","overview":"Schuyler Bailar, Chella Man, and Cal Calamia come together through friendship and solidarity to take on an Ironman, claiming, (and fully enjoying) their place in a world of sport where trans bodies are increasingly questioned, politicized, and pushed out.  At a time when public visibility can make trans people both targets and symbols, simply showing up becomes a statement. But 3 Hearts of Iron is not a story about proving their humanity through suffering. Surrounded by a fierce and loving community, Schuyler, Chella, and Cal move through the race with joy, interdependence, determination, and extraordinary athleticism.  Together, they offer a different image of trans life in sport: not one defined by debate or exclusion, but by friendship, excellence, and belonging. In doing so, they show that trans people do more than belong in sports: they have the power to transform and expand what sports can be.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/2m9gpzqeFmWZbr3HDhq9UbFtlk9.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"CR","name":"Costa Rica"}],"release_date":"2026-11-12","revenue":0,"runtime":13,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"3 Hearts of Iron","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3603261,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Schuyler Bailar","original_name":"Schuyler Bailar","popularity":0.0796,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":5,"character":"","credit_id":"6af3ec8bce79c040c0c56c3e","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3089494,"known_for_department":"Directing","name